# Copy to .env.local (never committed) and fill in.

# scripts/deploy.sh <region>: the SSH target of each region's box (set up by deploy/setup-server.sh), by its
# id in regions.json. The public URLs live in regions.json.
DEPLOY_HOST_IN=ubuntu@in.game.example.com
DEPLOY_HOST_US=ubuntu@us.game.example.com

# Optional PostHog project key (phc_…). Production builds send analytics only when it's set.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=

# Optional PostHog survey ids (API type, made in PostHog's Surveys tab). The game draws them itself; PostHog
# decides who sees them and keeps the answers. Questions are asked in order (no branching); rating, single and
# multiple choice, and open text are drawn, link questions are skipped. Turn on partial responses: each answer
# is sent as it's given.
# Run survey: on the results card, never after a player's first finish and at most once a page session. Lead
# with a rating question (emoji, scale 3 or 5, for the hippo faces), then optionally an open one. Set a wait
# period to keep it rare.
VITE_POSTHOG_RUN_SURVEY=
# Feedback survey: the Feedback button on the main menu and pause menu, shown only while this survey is active
# for the player. Repeat it always and set no wait period, or the button disappears after one use.
VITE_POSTHOG_FEEDBACK_SURVEY=
